      "channel": "comms_huddle",
      "channelLabel": "Comms Huddle",
      "recipients": [
        "ALL"
      ],
      "messageType": "broadcast",
      "respondingTo": null,
      "content": "Morning all. Before we get into anything — has anyone seen the new coffee machine on the third floor? Facilities swapped it out overnight. It's actually decent for once."
