      "messageType": "broadcast",
      "respondingTo": "20460522_03_006",
      "content": "Here is what I want us to do. First — no one engages with the report publicly. No Flex comments, no quote-tweets, no \"our take\" posts. We do not want to draw attention. Second — Platform Trust, where are we on the usage guidelines from yesterday? I want those ready to show Ajay by end of week."
