      "messageType": "broadcast",
      "respondingTo": "20460528_07_010",
      "content": "There were two prior incidents — both sub-30-minute resolutions and under SLA thresholds. This one is more significant because of the cloud provider zone event. It's not a product defect — it's infrastructure capacity. Completely different root cause."
