      "messageType": "broadcast",
      "respondingTo": "20460528_07_013",
      "content": "Platform back up as of 10:38 AM. All work-order notifications processing. Resident complaints are tapering. Total outage duration: 1 hour 58 minutes — under the 4-hour SLA threshold. No formal client notifications required per Legal review."
