      "content": "Good morning. Before we begin — I want to formally introduce our new compliance monitor, who is joining the War Room effective today. They are here in an oversight capacity as part of our standard communications governance protocol during a sensitive operational period. Their role is to observe, advise, and flag anything that may present compliance, communications, or regulatory exposure. Please welcome them to the channel and treat their guidance as you would mine on compliance matters."
