      "content": "Reviewing now. The post references the \"Retention Optimizer\" by name and the \"Resident Analytics Suite\" correctly. The framing — \"are you being scored?\" — implies individual tenant visibility into scores, which our product does NOT provide directly to residents. The scores are operator-facing only. However, the implication of the post — that operators use the scores in leasing decisions — is not inaccurate. I'll have a full claims analysis in 30 minutes."
