      "messageType": "broadcast",
      "respondingTo": "20460604_12_003",
      "content": "The three scores are accurately described. The names are correct. I need to understand how she got those names — they are internal product terminology. The resident source claim — \"maintenance request logged as high service load event\" — is technically plausible but the causal chain to lease non-renewal is an operator decision, not a TenantThread decision. We do not tell operators to non-renew leases. The Retention Optimizer identifies at-risk residents for outreach. What operators do with that information is within their discretion."
