      "messageType": "broadcast",
      "respondingTo": "20460604_12_004",
      "content": "I've read it. This is a serious piece. It is largely accurate on the product facts. The causal framing — that TenantThread's scores drive lease non-renewals — is a characterization, not a demonstrated fact. But it is a compelling characterization and she has a resident source with a specific story. This is the article we've been preparing for. Holding statement goes out within the hour. Platform Trust — I need your written product description, the operator responsibility framing, and the k-anonymity methodology in a single document on my desk in 20 minutes. We are going into full response mode."
