      "messageType": "public_post",
      "respondingTo": null,
      "content": "\"For the record: OceanCrunch's report that TenantThread is 'poised for ResidentIQ takeover' is inaccurate. TenantThread publicly denied ResidentIQ acquisition discussions on its official channel earlier today. We are formally requesting a correction. Our legal team remains engaged with all outlets committed to factual reporting on TenantThread's governance reforms.\""
