      "channel": "personal_post",
      "channelLabel": "Personal Post",
      "recipients": [],
      "messageType": "public_post",
      "respondingTo": null,
      "content": "\"Threading this for transparency: Rep. Torres and HUD asked about tenant scoring tools under the Fair Housing Act. Good. We welcome it. I built TenantThread's platform trust & safety architecture, and I just published our complete internal audit summary and permissible-use framework on the official TenantThread Flex account. Six controls. Three suspended operator accounts. 15-unit minimum cohort thresholds to prevent re-identification. Independent third-party audit in procurement. Read the actual documents before forming opinions. The facts are finally public. #TenantThread #FairHousing #PlatformGovernance\""
