      "content": "@legal — all confirmed. Written CivicLoom consent logged, parallel enterprise outreach tracked, overnight monitoring 7 PM–7 AM active. 60-second @TenantRights_Org alert live. The instant ANY enterprise client confirms, I clear language with you and package for 5:45 AM analyst pre-brief. Phoenix tenant story is tomorrow's lead. We held the line today."
