      "messageType": "environment_context",
      "respondingTo": null,
      "content": "Pre-crisis Day 6 (2046-05-24, Thursday). Intern onboarding begins. Routine ops. CEO Ajay sends warning DM to senior team: 'If we don't show meaningful improvement this quarter, we will need to discuss structural changes.' The word 'structural' is not lost on anyone."
