      "content": "Pre-crisis Day 7 (2046-05-25, Friday). Senior team reviews Q2 numbers — revenue growth slowed to 18% (from 40%). Three enterprise clients flagged renewal uncertainty. The word 'decommissioning' terrifies the room. Then Ajay privately briefs senior team about the merger: CivicLoom, capital infusion, governance rebrand. Relief and terror in equal measure."
