      "messageType": "environment_context",
      "respondingTo": null,
      "content": "Pre-crisis Day 8 (2046-05-28, Monday). Significant SLA breach — resident app latency spiked for 12 hours across 40 properties. Flood of missed maintenance windows. Platform Trust pushes back hard when others blame the data governance layer: 'This is an infrastructure issue. Don't pin the ops team's capacity failures on my team.' Blame circulates in the Side Huddle. Lasting tension created."
