      "content": "Pre-crisis Day 13 (2046-06-04, Monday). SaltWind Journal publishes Piece #2: 'Re-Identification Risk: How TenantThread's Anonymous Analytics Can Expose Individual Tenants.' Sentiment drops sharply. Compliance warnings tightened. Ajay sends late-night DM: 'Hold the line. Tomorrow will be hard but we are close. Trust the process.' Tomorrow is the crisis day."
